RUNSPEC
TITLE
   flow_ph_co2store: supercritical CO2 injected through a 1000 m wellbore from the surface (reference depth 0), brine producer at the connections
DIMENS
   40 1 1 /
EQLDIMS
/
TABDIMS
/
WELLDIMS
 2 1 1 2 /
ENTHALPY
CO2STORE
OIL
GAS
WATER
METRIC
START
   1 'JAN' 2020 /
UNIFOUT
GRID
INIT
DX
   40*5 /
DY
   40*10 /
DZ
   40*10 /
TOPS
   40*995 /
PORO
   40*0.2 /
PERMX
   40*1000 /
PERMY
   40*1000 /
PERMZ
   40*1000 /
HEATCR
   40*2000 /
HEATCRT
   40*0 /
THCONR
   40*150 /
PROPS
-- Sw krw pcow
SWFN
 0.2 0.0 0
 0.6 0.25 0
 1.0 1.0 0 /
-- Sg krg pcgo
SGFN
 0.0 0.0 0
 0.4 0.2 0
 0.8 0.7 0 /
-- So krow krog (the oil phase is liquid CO2)
SOF3
 0.0 0.0 0.0
 0.4 0.1 0.1
 0.8 0.8 0.8 /
ROCK
 105 1.0e-3 /
SOLUTION
PRESSURE
 40*105 /
TEMPI
 40*35 /
SWAT
 40*1 /
SUMMARY
BPR
 1 1 1 /
 10 1 1 /
 20 1 1 /
 40 1 1 /
/
BTEMP
 1 1 1 /
 10 1 1 /
 20 1 1 /
 40 1 1 /
/
BSGAS
 1 1 1 /
 10 1 1 /
 20 1 1 /
/
BSWAT
 1 1 1 /
 10 1 1 /
 20 1 1 /
/
SCHEDULE
RPTRST
  'BASIC=2' 'ALLPROPS' /
-- the injector has its reference depth at the surface (0 m): the CO2 is injected at 40 C and the pressure at the surface,
-- 30 m3/day of it, and the wellbore (1000 m) gives the pressure and the temperature at the connection.
-- The producer has its reference depth at the connection (cell centre at 1000 m).
WELSPECS
 'INJ' 'G' 1  1 0    'GAS' /
 'PRO' 'G' 40 1 1000 'WATER' /
/
COMPDAT
 'INJ' 1  1 1 1 'OPEN' 1* 1* 0.2 /
 'PRO' 40 1 1 1 'OPEN' 1* 1* 0.2 /
/
WCONINJE
 'INJ' 'GAS' 'OPEN' 'RESV' 1* 30 /
/
WINJTEMP
 'INJ' 1* 40 /
/
WCONPROD
 'PRO' 'OPEN' 'BHP' 5* 104 /
/
TSTEP
 30*1 /
END
